pan begin="00:08.801" end="00:09.104">shuts </span><span begin="00:09.104" end="00:09.568">down</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:10.072" end="00:11.952"><span begin="00:10.072" end="00:10.401">You </span><span begin="00:10.401" end="00:10.937">never </span><span begin="00:10.937" end="00:11.560">lived </span><span begin="00:11.560" end="00:11.952">here</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.952" end="00:15.929"><span begin="00:11.952" end="00:12.273">And </span><span begin="00:12.273" end="00:12.537">I </span><span begin="00:12.537" end="00:13.033">never </span><span begin="00:13.033" end="00:13.697">found </span><span begin="00:14.152" end="00:14.464">what </span><span begin="00:14.464" end="00:14.825">I </span><span begin="00:14.825" end="00:15.144">thought </span><span begin="00:15.144" end="00:15.641">I </span><span begin="00:15.641" end="00:15.929">did</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.497" end="00:17.537"><span begin="00:16.497" end="00:16.720">There's </span><span begin="00:16.720" end="00:16.912">a </span><span begin="00:16.912" end="00:17.137">million </span><span begin="00:17.137" end="00:17.537">things</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:17.961" end="00:19.784"><span begin="00:17.961" end="00:18.161">There's </span><span begin="00:18.161" end="00:18.360">a </span><span begin="00:18.360" end="00:18.600">million </span><span begin="00:18.600" end="00:18.944">things </span><span begin="00:18.944" end="00:19.217">I </span><span begin="00:19.217" end="00:19.552">could </span><span begin="00:19.552" end="00:19.784">say</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.200" end="00:21.615"><span begin="00:20.200" end="00:20.416">But </span><span begin="00:20.416" end="00:20.632">you </span><span begin="00:20.632" end="00:20.855">never </span><span begin="00:20.855" end="00:21.079">really </span><span begin="00:21.079" end="00:21.352">knew </span><span begin="00:21.352" end="00:21.615">that</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.615" end="00:24.024"><spa